%% WeaveNYC — To-Be Conceptual: 系统参与者与交互
%% Source: 06_Blueprints.md §2.1

flowchart LR
  subgraph Users ["用户层"]
    R[Resident App<br/>求助者]
    H[Helper App<br/>提供者]
  end

  subgraph Community ["社区层"]
    A[Anchor Node<br/>+ Admin Console]
  end

  subgraph Cloud ["云服务层"]
    C[Cloud Intelligence<br/>匹配/风控/通知]
    D[(Directory DB<br/>官方资源目录)]
  end

  R <-->|posts / matches| A
  H <-->|posts / matches| A
  A <-->|sync / aggregate| C
  C <-->|read / write| D
  D --> R

  style R fill:#FFE0B2,stroke:#E65100
  style H fill:#C8E6C9,stroke:#2E7D32
  style A fill:#CE93D8,stroke:#6A1B9A
  style C fill:#90CAF9,stroke:#1565C0
  style D fill:#B0BEC5,stroke:#37474F
